From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 21:55:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: qualcomm: ppe: add dual-VLAN DSA offload

Extend the Qualcomm PPE ingress translation and flow topology paths to
match and modify SVID and CVID independently. Preserve the DSA service
tag on CPU-punted traffic and allow one inner customer VLAN to coexist
with the RTL837x 802.1ad source-port tag.

Allow VLAN-aware DSA routed-flow offload only for the dedicated RTL837x
protocol. The legacy VSC73XX-compatible 802.1Q, QCA4B and direct-PHY
paths retain their existing behavior.

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
